    "text": "1. Select Courses\n\n2. Analyzing\n\n3. Review Changes\n\n4. Download & Sync\n\n5. Complete\n\nReview Changes\nHelp\nSelect the files you want to sync, and ignore the ones you don't need.\n11\nNew files\n6\nUpdates available\n2\nEdited locally\n4\nDeleted locally\n2\nDeleted on Canvas\nSmart Select\nBy filetype\n\nDOCX (all)\n\nHTML (all)\n\nJPG (all)\n\nJS (all)\n\nMD (none)\n\nPDF (6/8)\n\nTXT (3/6)\n\nSelect All\n\nDeselect All\n\n1.\nProgrammering og udvikling af små systemer samt databaser (LA)\nProgrammering og udvikling af små systemer samt databaser (LA E25 BINTO1064U)\n21 files pending sync\n192 files up to date\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nNew Files\n\nSelect All here\n\nDeselect All here\n\nMove deselected files to Ignored (0)\n\nBrand new files available on Canvas that you don't have locally yet.\n\ngk2 vejl_løsn JS 1.2 KB\n\ng1 darts vejl_løsn JS 1.2 KB\n\nDebug - shop - 1 TXT 1.4 KB\n\nFiktiv Eksamensopgave3 PDF 138.6 KB ⚠️\n\nforelæsningsnoter 13 OO UML DOCX 30.5 KB ⚠️\n\nBiblioteks_SSD_vejl JPG 31.5 KB ⚠️\n\nLecture 15 Database Design Exercises solutions NY PDF 135.3 KB ⚠️\n\nG7-Assignment-1 PDF 95.8 KB\n\nG7-Assignment PDF 95.8 KB\n\nG4 HTML\n\ntemp HTML\n\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nUpdates Available\n\nSelect All here\n\nDeselect All here\n\nMove deselected files to Ignored (0)\n\nYour local copies haven't been edited, so they'll be replaced in place with the newer Canvas version.\n\ng5_fælles_feedback PDF 141.2 KB\n\nDebug - Inventory - 1 TXT 1.4 KB\n\nUMLcases PDF 139.3 KB\n\nSQL Opgave Vejl_sql TXT 2.5 KB\n\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nUpdates Available — You've Edited These\n\nSelect All here\n\nDeselect All here\n\nMove deselected files to Ignored (2)\n\nYou've modified your local copies of these files. They are unchecked by default to protect your edits. If you sync them, the new Canvas version will be saved alongside as _NewVersion — your edited copy is never touched.\n\nhints MD 14.8 KB\n\nCreate_ILearn_tables_sql TXT 3.1 KB\n\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nDeleted Locally\n\nSelect All here\n\nDeselect All here\n\nMove deselected files to Ignored (4)\n\nThese files are missing from your Course Folder. They are unchecked by default since your deletion may have been intentional. Select any files you'd like to re-download, or ignore them with the button below.\n\nminefeltVEJL_js TXT 857 B\n\nEksamen 2023E Ordinær Klasse opgave PDF 53.4 KB\n\nDebug - grades - 1 TXT 990 B\n\nFiktiv Eksamensopgave PDF 42.7 KB\n\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nDeleted on Canvas (Kept Locally)\n\nThese files were deleted by the teacher on Canvas. They are preserved locally for your safety.\n\nGhostFile_0_StudieTimerVejl_js\nTXT\n4.0 KB\nGhostFile_1_styling_opgave102_css\nTXT\n4.2 KB\nkeyboard_arrow_down\n\nIgnored Files\n\nRestore All Ignored Files\n\nThese files are safely ignored and will not be synced.\n\nØvelser_Kapitel11og15\nMD\n6.2 KB\nForelæsning 17 ILearn SQL Solutions\nTXT\n5.6 KB\n⚠️ 4 new files look like files you may already have\nThey are the same size and type as files already in your course folder, but the names are too different to be certain it is the same file, so it was not matched. For example, “Fiktiv Eksamensopgave3.pdf” looks like “decoy 1 unrelated.pdf” in your folder. Hover the ⚠️ next to a file to see which of your files it resembles. You can leave it checked to download a fresh copy — your own files are never renamed, overwritten or deleted — uncheck it if you know you already have it, or use the eye icon to skip it for good.\n\nGo back\n\nSync & Download 15 files",
